{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24995","headline":"游淮云寺 · 牟融","name":"游淮云寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云深锁沃州山，冠盖登临衆仰攀。\n松径风清闻鹤唳，昙花香瞑见僧还。\n玄机隐隐应难觉，尘事悠悠了不关。\n兴尽凡缘因未晚，裴回依旧到人间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}